      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Virtual Ants\": Cf.\n16.2 in Chapter 16 (\"Autonomous Agents and Self-Organization\")\nof Gary\nW. Flake:\nThe Computational\nBeauty of Nature. (Cambridge, MA: MIT Press, 1998).\n\n\n\n\nEssay about the artistic application of this idea:\nLeonel Maura: \"Swarm\nPaintings\"\n\n\n\nDiscrete \"virtual motion\" may also emerge in Cellular\nAutomata.",
